Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体：遗迹的 No.是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.43,0:00:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而这混沌超量变换
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是千尊的诅咒……》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说…… 原来是这么回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解开阿里特诅咒的方法！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）真的吗？ 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}施加在阿里特身上的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊的诅咒能解开吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正如千尊所说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将遗迹的 No.解放出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙被封印的力量就会解放 逐渐复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们在遗迹里所做的一切{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就等同于在帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 是啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸真是个天大的蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我不这么认为。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他对于我们将会遭遇的事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今为止
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.11,0:00:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经预测到了许多。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.25,0:00:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.31,0:00:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很难想象他会故意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}制造出让我们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.06,0:00:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷入不利的状况。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.87,0:01:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定 你的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是预测到了我们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是预测到了我们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了将巴利安七皇从咒缚中解放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而战斗这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 遗迹的 No.卡之中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定拥有解除
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上咒缚的力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.73,0:01:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹的 No.卡中……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超百 No.卡是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上诅咒的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹的 No.是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.57,0:01:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安七皇还是人类时的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记忆本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这两者应该是相反的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原 原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.69,0:01:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 用狮子心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.37,0:01:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒阿里特持有的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌之力的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}施加在阿里特身上的诅咒就能解除了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞。 干就干！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要召唤狮子心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽不够。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.26,0:01:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 现在我们手牌是零。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。 下一次抽卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决定一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.86,0:02:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在就来救你！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！ 快点救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我从这咒缚中解放出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我和阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！ 交给我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 热血沸腾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的心意传达到了 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤虹彩栗子球！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级1的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虹彩栗子球 栗子球 暗黑龙叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.54！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反骨斗士 狮心！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 No.…！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么 这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)阿里特！阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特为什么那么强啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.75,0:04:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.47,0:04:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)那还用说吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为有你们在啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要变得像阿里特一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.29,0:05:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请您小心。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有人盯上了你的性命。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？盯上了我的命？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇帝嫉妒你的人气。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！皇帝是我的挚友啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这嘛……可不好说啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇帝竟然要我的命》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.者们啊像往常一样保护我……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干什么 你们这帮家伙！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:06:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有里人。因杀人罪将你逮捕。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定是哪里搞错了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放我出去！ 放我出去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杀人犯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个恶棍！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.01,0:06:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卑鄙小人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 你被诅咒的人生。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你被挚友背叛{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怨恨他人 怨恨世间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被怨念与妄执所困走向死亡))
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错！ 没有一个人愿意相信我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连我以为是挚友的你也背叛了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 我要诅咒你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要诅咒你！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 总有一天 我会复活{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给这个世界带来灾祸！》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚… 刚才那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.81,0:07:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 是艾利特还是人类时的记忆？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮心与混沌产生了共鸣…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 这两只战斗的时候会发生什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·千！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾利特 我现在就帮你解开诅咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮心！ 攻击混沌！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 狮心的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.07,0:07:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击表示的 这张卡不会被战斗破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我所受到的战斗伤害也给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要承受的伤害是3900！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也要承受3900的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动拉普索迪·因·巴萨克的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡被装备时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我受到1000点以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个伤害减半…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏这张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动狮心效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值变为零时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将生命值变为100。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救命冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值归零这事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.39,0:08:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲击力可是很强烈的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咚·萨赞德)呜哦～！ 骗… 骗人的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的诅咒……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·萨赞德……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干掉了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.39,0:08:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我到底……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我被唐·萨赞德……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是被唐·萨赞德操控了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊……我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你们把我从那家伙的诅咒中……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！诅咒解除了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.65,0:09:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别过来！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么了啊，阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿里特）我们的战斗还没结束呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是巴利安七皇的阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.96,0:09:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是你的诅咒呢!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确我被唐·萨赞德操控着。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你应该看到了。我的过去。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那份憎恨怀于心中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 转生成了异晶人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的归宿只有异晶人世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要将其毁灭的你们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须和你们做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光体和你们的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激烈 热血 是最棒的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那样的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经 不可能再有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动墓地中狂想曲·吟游诗人的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 通过自身的效果被送入墓地时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌的怪兽卡1张送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 No.80！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狂装霸王 安魂曲·狂想曲！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将狂装霸王 安魂曲·狂想曲升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌化！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.80！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}镇魂的旋律将十全的神之世界修复！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.98,0:11:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}依附于我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}葬装霸王 安魂曲·狂想曲！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动异晶之力的 更进一步效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌怪兽·超量的特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以吸收超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每吸收一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力下降300！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮子心的超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊 这样一来恢复生命值的效果就！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.56,0:11:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动安魂曲·狂战士的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个混沌超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法 陷阱卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 发动安魂曲·狂战士的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.27,0:12:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次 装备给自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升2000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要提升凯埃斯托斯的攻击力？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮心龙是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会将受到的伤害也给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.51,0:12:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去会两败俱伤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}倒下的只会是你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.99,0:12:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了安魂圣器的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与之战斗的对手怪兽的效果将会无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}花椰菜 攻击狮心龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}花椰菜 攻击狮心龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.72,0:12:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你疯了吗！你们的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:12:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本没有陷阱卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 有的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将墓地里的陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}次元U型转弯发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.67,0:13:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能除外自己场上1只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 狮心 除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种陷阱有什么意义！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 墓地中虹栗子球的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我 受到直接攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以把这家伙特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然这样我就 破坏虹栗子球～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.37,0:13:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了啊 虹栗子球！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 我 就这样回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 维度U回合的更进一步的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这张卡 除外的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会在回合结束时回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼 总算是这个回合 撑过去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办才好啊 星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算诅咒解除了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被过去的憎恨缠住不放了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就像是又中了新的诅咒一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的诅咒……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹里的传说 在那之中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们的灵魂 纯粹而崇高。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.08,0:14:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不该去巴利安世界 倒不如说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前往星光界
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才应该是合适的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的他们 为何{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被憎恶与怨念束缚 堕入巴利安……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果 那份憎恨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是源于上千主上的阴谋……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在那嘀咕什么呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 用狮子心去破坏混沌吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用狮子心要怎么搞！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且刚才！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.11,0:14:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样也要做！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话说不定能抓住什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你小子 越来越像我了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 下一回合决胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.19,0:15:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动装备魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将王者圣外套装备给狮子心！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与战斗的怪兽攻击力变得相同！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.99,0:15:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 唐·萨赞德{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从我们遗迹的 No.卡中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.23,0:15:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要守住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量红·No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甚至不惜使用自己施下诅咒的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 那就一定！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:15:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮子心把混沌使者打飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.33,0:16:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！ 想同归于尽吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗！ 因为装备了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安魂曲·狂战士的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮子心的效果被无效了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算狮子心的效果被消除了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备卡圣外套的效果 也不会消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.08,0:16:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就能破坏混沌使者了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动「列克伊艾姆·因·巴萨库」的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将装备的这张卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使「卡艾斯托斯」的破坏无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 被破坏的就只有你的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动王者圣外套的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽在战斗中被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡送去墓地可以使破坏无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动送去墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}王者圣外套的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.07,0:17:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏无效的效果在自己的回合使用时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备过的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.37,0:17:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与对方怪兽交换攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再战斗一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)莱昂哈特再次攻击凯斯特斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.81,0:17:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因杀人罪将你逮捕。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！这一定是哪里搞错了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老实点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特不可能做那种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.33,0:17:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特和我 情同兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇帝…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他正是 在我死后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将成为下一任皇帝{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}治理这个国家的勇者。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 放了阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.87,0:18:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(唐·萨赞德)多管闲事。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么人!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.19,0:18:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(唐·萨赞德)吾乃 唐·萨赞德。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…那个男人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾乃巴利安之神。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾需要你的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那不屈的灵魂与深不可测的斗志。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那将成为吾之食粮。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的力量，怎能让星光界之流
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，你的记忆已被改写。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是被所信之人背叛惨遭抹杀的含恨战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那份愤怒与憎恨怀于心中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:18:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化身为巴利安，苏醒过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}判处汝死罪！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.37,0:19:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我真正的记忆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特…。唔 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光体 我的记忆是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.35,0:19:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才看到的，就是你的真正记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是那份记忆被改写
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被植入了憎恨。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.03,0:19:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让你的灵魂前往巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.44,0:19:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直被谎言操控着……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.45,0:19:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我对你的同伴们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做了无法挽回的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:19:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:20:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，你只是被利用了而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊主在自己耗尽力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被封印进七个遗迹的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就已经将最后的力量释放到了野外。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.39,0:20:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙以可怕的深谋远虑{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.43,0:20:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直在谋划着让自己复活的计划。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我完全中了那个圈套……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.63,0:20:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特，把力量借给我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了打倒千尊主。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。虽然我中了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·千尊的陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我是巴利安七皇的战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.95,0:20:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七皇和我们一定能互相理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须打倒你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.23,0:20:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，在你们面前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现了不得不
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.05,0:20:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来协助你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把唐·千尊揍飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.07,0:20:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是巨大的一步。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.30,0:20:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果其他七皇也被篡改了过去的记忆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.39,0:20:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那他们也能被解放。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要尽快解决唐·千尊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙在贝库塔体内。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.94,0:21:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.92,0:21:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然和贝库塔……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔现在在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.05,0:21:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要去巴利安世界就一定能找到线索。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧，去巴利安世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.91,0:21:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)阿里特叛变了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(上千主上)事情紧急。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}立刻去夺走其他七皇的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然，我正有此意。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)我等好久了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格，杜尔伯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.89,0:21:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉格)贝库塔！你为什么在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.28,0:21:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来，把我们几个的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}合而为一的时候到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(杜尔伯)我们的力量应该
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早就已经合而为一了才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你根本不懂啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.13,0:21:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说的是就在这里把你们打趴下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.57,0:21:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同你的灵魂，把全部力量都收下！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.11,0:22:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈…啊哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.01,0:23:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.41,0:23:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.27,0:23:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.74,0:23:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.06,0:24:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.12,0:24:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.98,0:24:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.61,0:24:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
